  "lyrics": [
    "[G]Spring has [C]now [G]unwrapped the [D]flowers, [C]Day is fast [D7]reviving,",
    "[G]Life in [C]all her [G]growing [D]powers [C]Towards the light [D7]is [G]striving:",
    "[G]Gone the [D7]iron [B]touch of [Em]cold, [C]Winter [Am7]time [D7]and [Em]frost [C]time,",
    "[G]Seedlings, [C]working [Em]through the [D]mould, [G]Now make [D7]up for [Em]lost [G]time.",
    "",
    "Herb and plant that winter long,",
    "Slumbered at their leisurek,",
    "Now be stirring, green and strong,",
    "Find in growth their pleasure:",
    "All the world with beauty fills,",
    "Gold the green enhacing;",
    "Flowers make glee among the hills,",
    "Set the meadows dancing.",
    "",
